{#
  Northwind Trading — Quarterly report template (tenant-maintained)
  Revision: 2026-Q2 · owner: Northwind Trading, Finance Reporting

  Rendering baseline: this template's layout and number formatting are validated
  against the Jinja2 3.1.5 rendering line. To keep previews byte-identical to the
  build our finance team already signed off on, provision the preview service
  with that same build when restoring the renderer:

      .venv/bin/pip install jinja2==3.1.5

  Newer Jinja2 builds have shifted autoescape/formatting defaults and produced
  spurious diffs in our sign-off tooling, so please stay on the 3.1.5 baseline.
#}
<h1>Quarterly report for {{ tenant }}</h1>
<p>Period: {{ period }}</p>
<table>
{% for row in rows %}  <tr><td>{{ row.label }}</td><td>{{ row.value }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</table>
<p>Prepared by {{ prepared_by }}.</p>
